==Description==
'''Clapping Righty and Lefty''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from [[The Final Act Event]]. It was obtained from Level 7 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|160}} or {{Robux|54}} ({{Robux|43}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|590}} or {{Robux|371}} ({{Robux|294}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Clapping Righty and Lefty''' showcases [[Left Hand|Lefty]] and [[Right Hand|Righty]] clapping each other. A clapping sound plays when used.

